  "description": "Fast and playful. Race and Trail. The downcountry ripper! You're going to be crushing PRs and impressing your buddies... plus you can still rip the drops and gaps with confidence.\n\nWhy the Arktos 125?\n\nThe New Arktos 125 is the perfect blend of fast and fun. Shorter travel means more efficiency, with a super-responsive and nimble frame. Is it a XC bike? Nah… This thing is made to be ridden hard, and built up so it can take a beating. Beat your buddies uphill, then impress the group with some full-send-ability.\n\nThe Arktos has unlocked the power of modern geo, now with improved linkage for more travel and advanced kinematics. Our signature Sine Suspension virtually eliminates ‘pedal bob’, providing instant, efficient, forward power to attack climbs, rollers and sprints.\n\nWhen it’s time to get sendy, the 130mm/125mm of FOX Factory, Kashima-coated front/rear suspension punches well above its weight.\n\nIf you like to pedal, the Arktos 125 will surely be your new favorite ride.\n\nOne Model to RIDE Them All:\nConversion Kits:Quickly transform your 125 into a 140 or even a 150 (and back again) with Alchemy’s conversion kits: Get two (or three) bikes in one – for a fraction of the cost of buying a second bike – and always have the ideal rig for your immediate riding plans. Kits include corresponding shock and fork, and any necessary links for changes.",
